,[28015,19.3,1974,56,112,28],[28016,19.6,1974,56,110,27]],"links":[["Bennett County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/south-dakota/bennett-county"],["ARC or PLC in Bennett County","/arc-plc/south-dakota/bennett-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 15 grids runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 40 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle saw September to October at 138% and October to November at 63%. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 47% and March to April at 65%. On grid 27713, the preliminary estimate for August to September 2026 is 107.8, and that figure can still change.</p>"}
